\n    return out\n```\n{\"action\": \"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}},{"step":138,"kind":"reprompt","phase":"act","t0":1790611353.684,"t1":1790611362.764,"alias":"task-3243689f","message":"Your program was checked on earlier pair 2 at no cost and its output is wrong. It gave\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9\n9 1 9 1 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9\n9 1 1 1 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9\n9 1 9 1 1 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 2 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 5 5\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 9 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 5 9\n1 1 1 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n7 7 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n7 7 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n7 7 9 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\nwhere the pair's output is\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 1 9\n9 7 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 1 9\n9 7 7 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 1 1 9\n9 7 9 7 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 9 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 7 9 9 9 9 2 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 7 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 5 5\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 2 2 9 9 9 9 9 5 9\n1 1 1 1 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 2 9 9 9 